{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "version": 1,
  "reviewedAt": "2026-11-08",
  "upstreamCommit": "8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad",
  "quotes": [
    {
      "id": "h-1c431d80-b659-40f6-aa48-7082a29a882f",
      "text": "祈祷着今后的你的人生，永远都有幸福的“魔法”相伴。",
      "work": "樱花，萌放。",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/hitokoto-osc/sentences-bundle/blob/8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad/sentences/c.json#L7760",
      "upstreamId": 8879,
      "upstreamCategory": "c",
      "preferred": true,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "note": "社区收录译句；保留上游文字，不标注未经证实的说话人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "h-0a906b01-9508-4be1-9c10-21c348962c8f",
      "text": "如果摆出一副懂事的样子，压抑着自己心中感情而活的才算大人的话，那我宁可不要长大！",
      "work": "幸运草的约定",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/hitokoto-osc/sentences-bundle/blob/8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad/sentences/c.json#L9888",
      "upstreamId": 9873,
      "upstreamCategory": "c",
      "preferred": true,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "note": "社区收录译句；保留上游文字，不标注未经证实的说话人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "h-5751752b-b2b7-4eb1-82c6-5b4bb99a0f38",
      "text": "这，就是我为了活得像我自己，为了过上更好的生活，所得出的，属于我自己的答案。",
      "work": "幸运草的约定",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/hitokoto-osc/sentences-bundle/blob/8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad/sentences/c.json#L9902",
      "upstreamId": 9874,
      "upstreamCategory": "c",
      "preferred": true,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "note": "社区收录译句；保留上游文字，不标注未经证实的说话人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "h-d17624f7-03c3-4a14-81a4-56f6f469c120",
      "text": "勇敢地，活下去吧。人不就是要这样死皮赖脸地活着吗？",
      "work": "樱花，萌放。",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/hitokoto-osc/sentences-bundle/blob/8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad/sentences/c.json#L12296",
      "upstreamId": 10856,
      "upstreamCategory": "c",
      "preferred": true,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "note": "社区收录译句；保留上游文字，不标注未经证实的说话人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "h-518338ff-217f-4e1b-972d-09c7937bbb48",
      "text": "所谓入眠，就是活在死者的世界里。",
      "work": "樱花，萌放。",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/hitokoto-osc/sentences-bundle/blob/8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad/sentences/c.json#L12310",
      "upstreamId": 10857,
      "upstreamCategory": "c",
      "preferred": true,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "note": "社区收录译句；保留上游文字，不标注未经证实的说话人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "h-ca20a7ec-bd7c-4301-aa8b-f379b47a3fc5",
      "text": "心地善良的人，总是身不由己地遭受苦难。",
      "work": "樱花，萌放。",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/hitokoto-osc/sentences-bundle/blob/8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad/sentences/c.json#L12324",
      "upstreamId": 10858,
      "upstreamCategory": "c",
      "preferred": true,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "note": "社区收录译句；保留上游文字，不标注未经证实的说话人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "web-c46e13befa02a64a",
      "text": "只要行动，可能性就会诞生。",
      "work": "金色Loveriche",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://note.com/lovelykura_no_su/n/n4fa273275745",
      "preferred": true,
      "license": "原作权利人保留权利（短摘）",
      "note": "日文台词自译：行動を起こせば可能性が生まれる。"
    },
    {
      "id": "web-7d335177ee4c46fc",
      "text": "终于，我们能因为心意而在一起，而不再是职责。",
      "work": "金色Loveriche",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://genben.hatenablog.jp/entry/2025/03/15/103827",
      "preferred": true,
      "license": "原作权利人保留权利（短摘）",
      "note": "日文台词自译：ようやく役職でなく、気持ちで一緒にいられるわね。"
    },
    {
      "id": "web-2af0f035b8c730b5",
      "text": "所有的时光，都是黄金时光。",
      "work": "金色Loveriche",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://note.com/quirky_myrtle112/n/n66ddc26074a4",
      "preferred": true,
      "license": "原作权利人保留权利（短摘）",
      "note": "日文短摘自译：すべての時間がゴールデンタイムだから。"
    },
    {
      "id": "web-e209416d1c1ce5b8",
      "text": "我要为你准备一个最棒的今天。",
      "work": "金色Loveriche",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://note.com/quirky_myrtle112/n/n66ddc26074a4",
      "preferred": true,
      "license": "原作权利人保留权利（短摘）",
      "note": "日文短摘自译：最高の今日を用意する。"
    },
    {
      "id": "web-a5e64c1d97edf728",
      "text": "只有全力挑战过的人，才会真正败北。",
      "work": "樱之刻",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://baskmedia.jp/sakuranotoki-netabare/",
      "preferred": true,
      "license": "原作权利人保留权利（短摘）",
      "note": "日文短摘自译：本当に敗北出来るのは！本気で挑んだニンゲンだけザンス！"
    },
    {
      "id": "web-372227b859e8b818",
      "text": "你未完成的画笔，是追求无限的翅膀。",
      "work": "樱之刻",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://baskmedia.jp/sakuranotoki-netabare/",
      "preferred": true,
      "license": "原作权利人保留权利（短摘）",
      "note": "日文短摘自译：お前の、未完な筆は、無限を目指す翼だ。"
    },
    {
      "id": "web-ea7202c3b8506829",
      "text": "长夜伴浪破晓梦，梦晓破浪伴夜长。",
      "work": "樱之诗",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://moegirl.icu/zh-my/User:%E6%A0%80%E6%A2%A6/Galgame%E6%91%98%E5%BD%95",
      "preferred": true,
      "license": "原作权利人保留权利（短摘）",
      "note": "原作引用的和歌回文中文译句，参考页面所署作品。"
    },
    {
      "id": "web-9540faabb72538ad",
      "text": "人啊，幸福地活下去吧。",
      "work": "美好的每一天",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1uxbezvEoQ/",
      "preferred": true,
      "license": "原作权利人保留权利（短摘）",
      "note": "公开视频标题短摘。"
    },
    {
      "id": "web-50ae4b0c56bac9b2",
      "text": "向日葵坡道的后面，是美好的每一天。",
      "work": "美好的每一天",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1uxbezvEoQ/",
      "preferred": true,
      "license": "原作权利人保留权利（短摘）",
      "note": "公开视频标题短摘。"
    },
    {
      "id": "web-18630bceaf1f0196",
      "text": "黄昏时吹来的风，有些冷，却也让人安心。",
      "work": "魔法使之夜",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.dujingdian.cn/au/sayinglist/d8wt5opBdu-2",
      "preferred": true,
      "license": "原作权利人保留权利（短摘）",
      "note": "从页面明确标注魔法使之夜的段落截取独立短句。"
    },
    {
      "id": "web-ca76997a278915f1",
      "text": "回忆总会逐渐朦胧。",
      "work": "魔法使之夜",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.dujingdian.cn/au/sayinglist/d8wt5opBdu-2",
      "preferred": true,
      "license": "原作权利人保留权利（短摘）",
      "note": "同段独立短句。"
    },
    {
      "id": "web-ac89b07ea7afc5cf",
      "text": "在黑与白之间的独立舞台间漫步，念诵黑色童话的言咒。",
      "work": "魔法使之夜",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.dujingdian.cn/au/sayinglist/d8wt5opBdu",
      "preferred": true,
      "license": "原作权利人保留权利（短摘）",
      "note": "从页面明确标注魔法使之夜的段落截取独立分句。"
    },
    {
      "id": "web-e700816ace1fa942",
      "text": "不知者无罪。但是，知而无为，就是一种不可否认的罪孽。",
      "work": "秽翼的尤斯蒂娅",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://galgamewords.wordpress.com/2022/09/20/%E3%80%8A%E7%A7%BD%E7%BF%BC%E7%9A%84%E5%B0%A4%E6%96%AF%E8%92%82%E5%A8%85%E3%80%8B/",
      "preferred": true,
      "license": "原作权利人保留权利（短摘）",
      "note": "合并网页换行。"
    },
    {
      "id": "h-aed578ce-38ee-4279-9576-9ff61b31a392",
      "text": "就算一次也好，我想在这颗星球上尽情奔跑。",
      "work": "eden*",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/hitokoto-osc/sentences-bundle/blob/8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad/sentences/c.json#L32",
      "upstreamId": 287,
      "upstreamCategory": "c",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "note": "社区收录译句；保留上游文字，不标注未经证实的说话人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "h-838219db-13f7-49c0-93c4-e52f87fa0b05",
      "text": "无论发生什么，都请不要后悔与我的相遇……",
      "work": "CLANNAD",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/hitokoto-osc/sentences-bundle/blob/8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad/sentences/c.json#L130",
      "upstreamId": 294,
      "upstreamCategory": "c",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "note": "社区收录译句；保留上游文字，不标注未经证实的说话人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "h-b844bbc8-f866-45c3-9a6f-8a48026cf6e5",
      "text": "谎言不一定是谎言，被发现的谎言，才算是谎言。",
      "work": "秋之回忆",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/hitokoto-osc/sentences-bundle/blob/8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad/sentences/c.json#L186",
      "upstreamId": 298,
      "upstreamCategory": "c",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "note": "社区收录译句；保留上游文字，不标注未经证实的说话人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "h-ad663796-f067-4b17-809b-18b2a6cb9855",
      "text": "人总是会变的，不要害怕改变哦。",
      "work": "秋之回忆",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/hitokoto-osc/sentences-bundle/blob/8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad/sentences/c.json#L214",
      "upstreamId": 300,
      "upstreamCategory": "c",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "note": "社区收录译句；保留上游文字，不标注未经证实的说话人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "h-123dd35a-abb3-40b9-9e8a-c3305758ba26",
      "text": "那随风飘荡的蒲公英种子，会在什么时候决定自己的命运呢？",
      "work": "沙耶之歌",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/hitokoto-osc/sentences-bundle/blob/8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad/sentences/c.json#L438",
      "upstreamId": 661,
      "upstreamCategory": "c",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "note": "社区收录译句；保留上游文字，不标注未经证实的说话人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "h-5db3f43b-ed95-4752-bd75-83d64c260c08",
      "text": "有了她灿烂的笑脸,有了活下去面对每一天的勇气。",
      "work": "沙耶之歌",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/hitokoto-osc/sentences-bundle/blob/8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad/sentences/c.json#L452",
      "upstreamId": 662,
      "upstreamCategory": "c",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "note": "社区收录译句；保留上游文字，不标注未经证实的说话人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "h-ba4bc57b-9563-4204-9ca4-028c7510eace",
      "text": "最后呢，在这片沙漠之中，至少我能知道还会有一个，珍爱这朵花儿的人。有一个人就足够了。",
      "work": "沙耶之歌",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/hitokoto-osc/sentences-bundle/blob/8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad/sentences/c.json#L466",
      "upstreamId": 663,
      "upstreamCategory": "c",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "note": "社区收录译句；保留上游文字，不标注未经证实的说话人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "h-61739833-ca8f-4bb6-ba00-de2b167932f5",
      "text": "让留下的人，笑着活下去",
      "work": "水仙 narcissu",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/hitokoto-osc/sentences-bundle/blob/8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad/sentences/c.json#L900",
      "upstreamId": 934,
      "upstreamCategory": "c",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "note": "社区收录译句；保留上游文字，不标注未经证实的说话人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "h-62995980-3442-4097-bccd-cd0ad54c92ca",
      "text": "为了明天和下个明天.怀抱着籍由互相弥补而获得,无可取代的平静.",
      "work": "KARAKARA",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/hitokoto-osc/sentences-bundle/blob/8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad/sentences/c.json#L1208",
      "upstreamId": 3662,
      "upstreamCategory": "c",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "note": "社区收录译句；保留上游文字，不标注未经证实的说话人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "h-f4a21f88-15bc-45e0-a76a-1dfe67b53699",
      "text": "我们都是在不曾谋面之张开的神手掌上起舞的命运的奴隶。",
      "work": "11eyes",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/hitokoto-osc/sentences-bundle/blob/8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad/sentences/c.json#L1852",
      "upstreamId": 4154,
      "upstreamCategory": "c",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "note": "社区收录译句；保留上游文字，不标注未经证实的说话人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "h-c995f44c-4221-4110-8df2-b4fca5d8b3d3",
      "text": "流淌的命运之河的终点，也许在这一刻就被决定好了。",
      "work": "11eyes",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/hitokoto-osc/sentences-bundle/blob/8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad/sentences/c.json#L1866",
      "upstreamId": 4155,
      "upstreamCategory": "c",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "note": "社区收录译句；保留上游文字，不标注未经证实的说话人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "h-de9d46a1-ef61-465d-b9b4-610448e1fa41",
      "text": "正因为不会发生，所以才叫奇迹。",
      "work": "Kanon",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/hitokoto-osc/sentences-bundle/blob/8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad/sentences/c.json#L2132",
      "upstreamId": 4261,
      "upstreamCategory": "c",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "note": "社区收录译句；保留上游文字，不标注未经证实的说话人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "h-3572c8c8-3d53-47af-a142-5ebf47b26cb5",
      "text": "明天会吹拂着明天的风。",
      "work": "Summer Pockets",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/hitokoto-osc/sentences-bundle/blob/8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad/sentences/c.json#L2286",
      "upstreamId": 4448,
      "upstreamCategory": "c",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "note": "社区收录译句；保留上游文字，不标注未经证实的说话人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "h-880c967a-a4a1-4332-a5b6-afa94d5f5362",
      "text": "虽然，灯塔已经失去了光明……但是，只要有你的那首歌在，就一定能将那些人再次导向此方。",
      "work": "Summer Pockets",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/hitokoto-osc/sentences-bundle/blob/8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad/sentences/c.json#L2300",
      "upstreamId": 4449,
      "upstreamCategory": "c",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "note": "社区收录译句；保留上游文字，不标注未经证实的说话人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "h-3890a83c-7217-45e3-9636-1b24205d6b05",
      "text": "就算我们知道了彼此总有一天会分别，现在的时光，也绝不是没有意义的。",
      "work": "Summer Pockets",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/hitokoto-osc/sentences-bundle/blob/8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad/sentences/c.json#L2342",
      "upstreamId": 4472,
      "upstreamCategory": "c",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "note": "社区收录译句；保留上游文字，不标注未经证实的说话人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "h-e9319e0d-b80b-4d7a-b1ee-7da02765c6f0",
      "text": "我会穿越那七大海洋，去和你相见。",
      "work": "Summer Pockets",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/hitokoto-osc/sentences-bundle/blob/8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad/sentences/c.json#L2356",
      "upstreamId": 4473,
      "upstreamCategory": "c",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "note": "社区收录译句；保留上游文字，不标注未经证实的说话人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "h-b28d2831-ef0c-4914-b6e5-51fdf80c6db1",
      "text": "帮助孩子，去实现他的梦想，对大人来说，那是无上的喜悦。",
      "work": "Summer Pockets",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/hitokoto-osc/sentences-bundle/blob/8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad/sentences/c.json#L2370",
      "upstreamId": 4474,
      "upstreamCategory": "c",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "note": "社区收录译句；保留上游文字，不标注未经证实的说话人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "h-6c231d19-63cb-4d80-a180-5acb88aebf74",
      "text": "为了我，你就永远当个废物吧；为了能让我好好努力，就一生，都成为我的负担吧。",
      "work": "白色相簿2",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/hitokoto-osc/sentences-bundle/blob/8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad/sentences/c.json#L2384",
      "upstreamId": 4500,
      "upstreamCategory": "c",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "note": "社区收录译句；保留上游文字，不标注未经证实的说话人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "h-ace34e49-4e52-4a30-b150-99360ae80be2",
      "text": "输给谁都可以，唯独不能输给自己。",
      "work": "Fate/stay night",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/hitokoto-osc/sentences-bundle/blob/8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad/sentences/c.json#L2874",
      "upstreamId": 5415,
      "upstreamCategory": "c",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "note": "社区收录译句；保留上游文字，不标注未经证实的说话人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "h-00dc7b46-015e-4f34-8ae6-6e35b78b67f0",
      "text": "直到她永久沉睡的那一天，世界啊，请你一定不要终结。",
      "work": "eden*",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/hitokoto-osc/sentences-bundle/blob/8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad/sentences/c.json#L3938",
      "upstreamId": 6903,
      "upstreamCategory": "c",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "note": "社区收录译句；保留上游文字，不标注未经证实的说话人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "h-27a88dd7-e35a-40fb-8863-50f9b9256a80",
      "text": "经历这种痛苦的人，我一个就够了！但为什么你就是不明白呢？！",
      "work": "美少女万华镜·理与迷宫的少女",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/hitokoto-osc/sentences-bundle/blob/8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad/sentences/c.json#L4050",
      "upstreamId": 7017,
      "upstreamCategory": "c",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "note": "社区收录译句；保留上游文字，不标注未经证实的说话人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "h-b52c33c6-5fec-4d82-b487-55526687fae9",
      "text": "我拒绝，再一次和你分开。",
      "work": "美少女万华镜·理与迷宫的少女",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/hitokoto-osc/sentences-bundle/blob/8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad/sentences/c.json#L4064",
      "upstreamId": 7018,
      "upstreamCategory": "c",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "note": "社区收录译句；保留上游文字，不标注未经证实的说话人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "h-271e1211-11da-49c4-b001-0733ec17e16d",
      "text": "所谓这个世界的真理，就是由爱所记录下的一切。",
      "work": "美少女万华镜·理与迷宫的少女",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/hitokoto-osc/sentences-bundle/blob/8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad/sentences/c.json#L4078",
      "upstreamId": 7019,
      "upstreamCategory": "c",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "note": "社区收录译句；保留上游文字，不标注未经证实的说话人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "h-969094d4-9ea0-4fce-be13-0eef8913b012",
      "text": "我要把你叫醒，哪怕赌上我的一切。",
      "work": "Summer Pockets",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/hitokoto-osc/sentences-bundle/blob/8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad/sentences/c.json#L4176",
      "upstreamId": 7099,
      "upstreamCategory": "c",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "note": "社区收录译句；保留上游文字，不标注未经证实的说话人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "h-939aedbf-bac0-4663-8438-7d1e953b4f66",
      "text": "不忘痛苦是为了让自己活下去啊。",
      "work": "爱上火车-Pure Station-",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/hitokoto-osc/sentences-bundle/blob/8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad/sentences/c.json#L4666",
      "upstreamId": 7535,
      "upstreamCategory": "c",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "note": "社区收录译句；保留上游文字，不标注未经证实的说话人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "h-3b490ca8-3f14-4de8-abf7-976d35e85e73",
      "text": "我们最应该关注的是自己的内心，如果内心蒙上了阴影，那么我们所看到的都将是蒙尘的景象。",
      "work": "爱上火车 Last Run!!",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/hitokoto-osc/sentences-bundle/blob/8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad/sentences/c.json#L5072",
      "upstreamId": 7765,
      "upstreamCategory": "c",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "note": "社区收录译句；保留上游文字，不标注未经证实的说话人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "h-e25c37ed-407a-4665-871c-10fce582b3c7",
      "text": "珍惜眼前的幸福吧，而不是去奢求无法得到的东西。",
      "work": "爱上火车 Last Run!!",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/hitokoto-osc/sentences-bundle/blob/8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad/sentences/c.json#L5156",
      "upstreamId": 7819,
      "upstreamCategory": "c",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "note": "社区收录译句；保留上游文字，不标注未经证实的说话人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "h-017d7273-6d22-4565-8f77-5a2ea00622e1",
      "text": "一旦绽开，就只剩下凋零这一结局。",
      "work": "生命的备件",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/hitokoto-osc/sentences-bundle/blob/8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad/sentences/c.json#L5884",
      "upstreamId": 8071,
      "upstreamCategory": "c",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "note": "社区收录译句；保留上游文字，不标注未经证实的说话人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "h-cac37539-a66c-473d-ae4d-13eb57e6b082",
      "text": "每个人都有优势和弱势，也有不断提升自我的能力；而提升自我的第一步，就是学会反思，以及察觉自己的问题。",
      "work": "Doki Doki Literature Club Plus!",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/hitokoto-osc/sentences-bundle/blob/8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad/sentences/c.json#L6080",
      "upstreamId": 8135,
      "upstreamCategory": "c",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "note": "社区收录译句；保留上游文字，不标注未经证实的说话人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "h-3465661a-5739-4bd1-85e0-ee83d21ebbfe",
      "text": "我们之所以与其他人分享交流，是因为想要向他人展现自我、向他人诉说自己的经历。",
      "work": "Doki Doki Literature Club Plus!",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/hitokoto-osc/sentences-bundle/blob/8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad/sentences/c.json#L6094",
      "upstreamId": 8136,
      "upstreamCategory": "c",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "note": "社区收录译句；保留上游文字，不标注未经证实的说话人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "h-8d1b9ed3-219f-4b16-9e23-6fbb444abee0",
      "text": "朝星空直接伸出手去，你永远只会觉得星星遥不可及，不是吗？",
      "work": "Doki Doki Literature Club Plus!",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/hitokoto-osc/sentences-bundle/blob/8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad/sentences/c.json#L6122",
      "upstreamId": 8140,
      "upstreamCategory": "c",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "note": "社区收录译句；保留上游文字，不标注未经证实的说话人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "h-fad54358-cff6-4026-b83c-41895cba6bc4",
      "text": "恋爱不是下定决心后才开始的，而是回过神来时就开始了哦。",
      "work": "与你相恋的恋爱Recette",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/hitokoto-osc/sentences-bundle/blob/8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad/sentences/c.json#L6682",
      "upstreamId": 8337,
      "upstreamCategory": "c",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "note": "社区收录译句；保留上游文字，不标注未经证实的说话人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "h-90de8723-534f-4554-b590-25e2302a7b65",
      "text": "我正在，寻找着我自己……请问，您知道些什么吗？",
      "work": "Summer Pockets",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/hitokoto-osc/sentences-bundle/blob/8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad/sentences/c.json#L6696",
      "upstreamId": 8340,
      "upstreamCategory": "c",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "note": "社区收录译句；保留上游文字，不标注未经证实的说话人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "h-f7a765ab-4e62-431a-a6d4-418724e23e0d",
      "text": "一个无法让自己幸福的人，是无法让任何人幸福的.....对于喜欢的人就更是如此了。",
      "work": "与你相恋的恋爱Recette",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/hitokoto-osc/sentences-bundle/blob/8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad/sentences/c.json#L6990",
      "upstreamId": 8523,
      "upstreamCategory": "c",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "note": "社区收录译句；保留上游文字，不标注未经证实的说话人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "h-bd9fcf05-2f96-452f-9556-cc834754c511",
      "text": "一直等待是得不到幸福的，要是有喜欢的东西，就要亲自出手去争取，这样做，才会好好珍惜得到的幸福。",
      "work": "与你相恋的恋爱Recette",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/hitokoto-osc/sentences-bundle/blob/8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad/sentences/c.json#L7018",
      "upstreamId": 8532,
      "upstreamCategory": "c",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "note": "社区收录译句；保留上游文字，不标注未经证实的说话人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "h-90d13838-3be5-41ab-aaa9-9f549aa0dfb6",
      "text": "在紧重的工作压力下不得不讲究轻重缓急的我们，是不是渐渐遗失了一些什么？",
      "work": "爱上火车 Last Run!!",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/hitokoto-osc/sentences-bundle/blob/8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad/sentences/c.json#L7144",
      "upstreamId": 8605,
      "upstreamCategory": "c",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "note": "社区收录译句；保留上游文字，不标注未经证实的说话人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "h-daa8ac21-3285-4ce9-be8e-c16f13bffe28",
      "text": "今天也怀着春天即将来访的预感，仰望着冬天的回忆。",
      "work": "星辰恋曲的白色永恒",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/hitokoto-osc/sentences-bundle/blob/8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad/sentences/c.json#L7746",
      "upstreamId": 8878,
      "upstreamCategory": "c",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "note": "社区收录译句；保留上游文字，不标注未经证实的说话人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "h-ddcdfa58-27a6-4320-adf3-0002949752e4",
      "text": "只要喜欢就可以了，然后用心去喜欢！",
      "work": "茸雪",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/hitokoto-osc/sentences-bundle/blob/8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad/sentences/c.json#L8572",
      "upstreamId": 9314,
      "upstreamCategory": "c",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "note": "社区收录译句；保留上游文字，不标注未经证实的说话人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "h-6dde779d-7053-4d79-b2ba-b13e86e9919f",
      "text": "我们的学校失去了一切，却有人捐赠了一架钢琴。",
      "work": "ATRI -My Dear Moments-",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/hitokoto-osc/sentences-bundle/blob/8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad/sentences/c.json#L9188",
      "upstreamId": 9584,
      "upstreamCategory": "c",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "note": "社区收录译句；保留上游文字，不标注未经证实的说话人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "h-b1e5433f-30ea-4af7-a11e-4df1b6fefde1",
      "text": "当城中亮起灯火，空中的繁星便黯然失色。",
      "work": "爱因斯坦携爱敬上",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/hitokoto-osc/sentences-bundle/blob/8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad/sentences/c.json#L9216",
      "upstreamId": 9586,
      "upstreamCategory": "c",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "note": "社区收录译句；保留上游文字，不标注未经证实的说话人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "h-7784bfe1-9f81-4f24-bdf6-bd6526fe087b",
      "text": "世界是一个装满熠熠生辉的宝石的宝石箱。",
      "work": "星空列车与白的旅行",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/hitokoto-osc/sentences-bundle/blob/8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad/sentences/c.json#L9300",
      "upstreamId": 9687,
      "upstreamCategory": "c",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "note": "社区收录译句；保留上游文字，不标注未经证实的说话人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "h-d610ed92-1c63-41ac-b7e6-15ab6209ee96",
      "text": "这篇故事属于拥有心灵的机器人少女，以及爱上少女的那位少年。",
      "work": "ATRI -My Dear Moments-",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/hitokoto-osc/sentences-bundle/blob/8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad/sentences/c.json#L9636",
      "upstreamId": 9808,
      "upstreamCategory": "c",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "note": "社区收录译句；保留上游文字，不标注未经证实的说话人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "h-61f234a3-db55-4f27-98f5-2aa320d95787",
      "text": "从这里到樱公馆，要缝多少针才能到达呢。",
      "work": "近月少女的礼仪",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/hitokoto-osc/sentences-bundle/blob/8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad/sentences/c.json#L9818",
      "upstreamId": 9851,
      "upstreamCategory": "c",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "note": "社区收录译句；保留上游文字，不标注未经证实的说话人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "h-48f7a5b0-3ea3-4a31-89f2-bf969364c911",
      "text": "就算是像牛郎和织女那样分开了我们最后也一定会再会的！",
      "work": "星空的记忆",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/hitokoto-osc/sentences-bundle/blob/8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad/sentences/c.json#L9944",
      "upstreamId": 9887,
      "upstreamCategory": "c",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "note": "社区收录译句；保留上游文字，不标注未经证实的说话人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "h-62b878d5-d65d-4e89-b109-66f9a293a712",
      "text": "人在孤独中降生，在孤独中死去。无论与谁关系再好，终究是一个人。",
      "work": "CROSS†CHANNEL",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/hitokoto-osc/sentences-bundle/blob/8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad/sentences/c.json#L9958",
      "upstreamId": 9888,
      "upstreamCategory": "c",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "note": "社区收录译句；保留上游文字，不标注未经证实的说话人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "h-8f87bd48-92cb-4295-bf93-d7fa4c303de4",
      "text": "祈祷明天对悠马来说，也是美好的一天。",
      "work": "五彩斑斓的世界",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/hitokoto-osc/sentences-bundle/blob/8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad/sentences/c.json#L10070",
      "upstreamId": 9931,
      "upstreamCategory": "c",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "note": "社区收录译句；保留上游文字，不标注未经证实的说话人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "h-882b91ba-23a5-4517-b6f2-6106aed9a66f",
      "text": "比起分手还是其他什么的，不得不停止对一个人的喜欢才是最痛苦的。",
      "work": "缘之空",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/hitokoto-osc/sentences-bundle/blob/8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad/sentences/c.json#L11680",
      "upstreamId": 10431,
      "upstreamCategory": "c",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "note": "社区收录译句；保留上游文字，不标注未经证实的说话人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "h-3f24ea08-26e4-4b3c-9bbb-818fafb69128",
      "text": "每个人，都有决定自己是谁的权利。",
      "work": "恋爱绮谭~不存在的夏天~",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/hitokoto-osc/sentences-bundle/blob/8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad/sentences/c.json#L11694",
      "upstreamId": 10437,
      "upstreamCategory": "c",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "note": "社区收录译句；保留上游文字，不标注未经证实的说话人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "h-4884a47d-9b2f-45d6-9fec-2c20d3ba3ce2",
      "text": "时间停止吧，你是多么美丽！",
      "work": "ATRI -My Dear Moments-",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/hitokoto-osc/sentences-bundle/blob/8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad/sentences/c.json#L11722",
      "upstreamId": 10495,
      "upstreamCategory": "c",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "note": "社区收录译句；保留上游文字，不标注未经证实的说话人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "h-421ee66a-b4e1-45ff-9c1e-79bcc5889fa4",
      "text": "花朵盛开往往只有很短时间，但是那会让我们等很久。",
      "work": "昙花",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/hitokoto-osc/sentences-bundle/blob/8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad/sentences/c.json#L12268",
      "upstreamId": 10854,
      "upstreamCategory": "c",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "note": "社区收录译句；保留上游文字，不标注未经证实的说话人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "h-116ff0c0-52d6-4dc2-8e88-bb310c2fd8d2",
      "text": "负重前行虽然累，但它让生命有了重量。",
      "work": "昙花",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/hitokoto-osc/sentences-bundle/blob/8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad/sentences/c.json#L12282",
      "upstreamId": 10855,
      "upstreamCategory": "c",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "note": "社区收录译句；保留上游文字，不标注未经证实的说话人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "h-9266dead-7d7b-486e-a49d-7b645c0ddfd5",
      "text": "人之所以为人，不是因为自由，而是因为反抗。",
      "work": "茸雪",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/hitokoto-osc/sentences-bundle/blob/8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad/sentences/c.json#L12338",
      "upstreamId": 10859,
      "upstreamCategory": "c",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "note": "社区收录译句；保留上游文字，不标注未经证实的说话人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "h-f866ed83-a6d8-43e6-ac59-482521b676c3",
      "text": "如果说，过去与未来不再拥有界限的话，那将会意味着什么呢？那可以称得上自由吗？不是反而哪里都去不了吗？",
      "work": "Summer Pockets",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/hitokoto-osc/sentences-bundle/blob/8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad/sentences/c.json#L12366",
      "upstreamId": 10861,
      "upstreamCategory": "c",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "note": "社区收录译句；保留上游文字，不标注未经证实的说话人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "h-d03068ae-ccbd-4970-abbe-47acb6c86b07",
      "text": "人生而不自由。当人认识到自己的不自由时，才是自由的开端。",
      "work": "茸雪",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/hitokoto-osc/sentences-bundle/blob/8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad/sentences/c.json#L12380",
      "upstreamId": 10863,
      "upstreamCategory": "c",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "note": "社区收录译句；保留上游文字，不标注未经证实的说话人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "h-010efa2b-d5ed-4581-a627-93316734c590",
      "text": "最终蝴蝶回到了家乡，静静地停到花上，蝴蝶对自己能遇见这么多人感到满足，于是蝴蝶静静地睡去了。",
      "work": "Summer Pockets",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/hitokoto-osc/sentences-bundle/blob/8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad/sentences/c.json#L12394",
      "upstreamId": 10866,
      "upstreamCategory": "c",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "note": "社区收录译句；保留上游文字，不标注未经证实的说话人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "h-4ef65072-436d-44f8-af3c-66632f5a83a7",
      "text": "对我而言，你就是地球的中心。",
      "work": "ATRI -My Dear Moments-",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/hitokoto-osc/sentences-bundle/blob/8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad/sentences/c.json#L14060",
      "upstreamId": 11334,
      "upstreamCategory": "c",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "note": "社区收录译句；保留上游文字，不标注未经证实的说话人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "h-a85721de-5150-4fff-a9d0-d5cf6fe66496",
      "text": "愿千年之恋，有朝一日能使万花怒放。",
      "work": "千恋万花",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/hitokoto-osc/sentences-bundle/blob/8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad/sentences/c.json#L14074",
      "upstreamId": 11335,
      "upstreamCategory": "c",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "note": "社区收录译句；保留上游文字，不标注未经证实的说话人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "h-05c3b910-8772-444c-92bb-302dfa178956",
      "text": "我不能在这里止步不前，我有我想要把握的未来。",
      "work": "魔女的夜宴",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/hitokoto-osc/sentences-bundle/blob/8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad/sentences/c.json#L14088",
      "upstreamId": 11337,
      "upstreamCategory": "c",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "note": "社区收录译句；保留上游文字，不标注未经证实的说话人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "h-60099b5c-6ec2-41e4-8e0e-ad6d84b13e3c",
      "text": "不论是乌云密布，还是大雨倾盆，星星总是会在同一个地方。",
      "work": "千恋万花",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/hitokoto-osc/sentences-bundle/blob/8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad/sentences/c.json#L14214",
      "upstreamId": 11348,
      "upstreamCategory": "c",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "note": "社区收录译句；保留上游文字，不标注未经证实的说话人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "h-26c12219-2c12-487d-8263-918f28ee262c",
      "text": "仿若春日林叶斑驳之影。",
      "work": "美少女万华镜 -献给曾是少女的你-",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/hitokoto-osc/sentences-bundle/blob/8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad/sentences/c.json#L14298",
      "upstreamId": 11385,
      "upstreamCategory": "c",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "note": "社区收录译句；保留上游文字，不标注未经证实的说话人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "h-b976b183-9404-4968-a60b-e333680c3a91",
      "text": "无法飞翔的翅膀也是有意义的，因为它是曾经翱翔于天空所留下的珍贵回忆。",
      "work": "AIR",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/hitokoto-osc/sentences-bundle/blob/8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad/sentences/a.json#L494",
      "upstreamId": 37,
      "upstreamCategory": "a",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "note": "社区收录译句；保留上游文字，不标注未经证实的说话人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "h-43a0bbc2-3b94-48bb-9c7f-76a8a84b1f0f",
      "text": "因为无法再见面，所以要笑着说再见。",
      "work": "AIR",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/hitokoto-osc/sentences-bundle/blob/8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad/sentences/a.json#L1124",
      "upstreamId": 84,
      "upstreamCategory": "a",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "note": "社区收录译句；保留上游文字，不标注未经证实的说话人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "h-00ae6650-3ae8-401f-927b-651a39564fb6",
      "text": "即使从梦中醒来，还会有回忆留下。",
      "work": "AIR",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/hitokoto-osc/sentences-bundle/blob/8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad/sentences/a.json#L1446",
      "upstreamId": 107,
      "upstreamCategory": "a",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "note": "社区收录译句；保留上游文字，不标注未经证实的说话人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "h-8ada268b-6e37-47f7-9216-53dd8d84b864",
      "text": "比起悲伤来说，无法分享快乐这件事，要更加的寂寞吧。",
      "work": "AIR",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/hitokoto-osc/sentences-bundle/blob/8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad/sentences/a.json#L1600",
      "upstreamId": 118,
      "upstreamCategory": "a",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "note": "社区收录译句；保留上游文字，不标注未经证实的说话人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "h-64e35bd0-fa2b-4cbc-a089-e8caa36406cd",
      "text": "我一直都在你身边 ，一直都在。",
      "work": "CLANNAD",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/hitokoto-osc/sentences-bundle/blob/8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad/sentences/a.json#L2566",
      "upstreamId": 187,
      "upstreamCategory": "a",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "note": "社区收录译句；保留上游文字，不标注未经证实的说话人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "h-78eb210e-890e-4fa2-b0a8-102e9f2f75bb",
      "text": "我们开始一起攀登，这长长的，长长的坡道。",
      "work": "CLANNAD",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/hitokoto-osc/sentences-bundle/blob/8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad/sentences/a.json#L2650",
      "upstreamId": 194,
      "upstreamCategory": "a",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "note": "社区收录译句；保留上游文字，不标注未经证实的说话人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "h-7c69a3ac-27ac-4309-b125-c97d4c5f3421",
      "text": "只要能努力，就应当去努力；只要还能前进，就要向前走去。",
      "work": "CLANNAD",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/hitokoto-osc/sentences-bundle/blob/8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad/sentences/a.json#L2692",
      "upstreamId": 197,
      "upstreamCategory": "a",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "note": "社区收录译句；保留上游文字，不标注未经证实的说话人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "h-30042146-31a4-4b5e-920a-caba417afae4",
      "text": "我不渴望什么在别的城市迎来的春天，只要和你在一起的春天就好，只要和你在一起就好",
      "work": "CLANNAD",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/hitokoto-osc/sentences-bundle/blob/8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad/sentences/a.json#L2860",
      "upstreamId": 209,
      "upstreamCategory": "a",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "note": "社区收录译句；保留上游文字，不标注未经证实的说话人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "h-7c0d5739-75c7-4884-8c12-e7a5c66d4708",
      "text": "我的终点，与幸福同在。",
      "work": "AIR",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/hitokoto-osc/sentences-bundle/blob/8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad/sentences/a.json#L2902",
      "upstreamId": 212,
      "upstreamCategory": "a",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "note": "社区收录译句；保留上游文字，不标注未经证实的说话人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "h-08655808-43a4-435c-9c79-3512f09b4953",
      "text": "前天是小兔子，昨天是小鹿，今天是你。",
      "work": "CLANNAD",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/hitokoto-osc/sentences-bundle/blob/8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad/sentences/a.json#L3084",
      "upstreamId": 226,
      "upstreamCategory": "a",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "note": "社区收录译句；保留上游文字，不标注未经证实的说话人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "h-232eb5a1-ff6a-4329-b7b8-f4f60b3fd5d0",
      "text": "如果你愿意的话，让我带您去吧，这座小镇，愿望实现的地方……",
      "work": "CLANNAD",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/hitokoto-osc/sentences-bundle/blob/8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad/sentences/a.json#L3252",
      "upstreamId": 238,
      "upstreamCategory": "a",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "note": "社区收录译句；保留上游文字，不标注未经证实的说话人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "h-f798e0d0-273a-45c9-bf5a-b93c6093224e",
      "text": "嗯，一个人也要加油，我是坚强的孩子。",
      "work": "AIR",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/hitokoto-osc/sentences-bundle/blob/8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad/sentences/a.json#L3308",
      "upstreamId": 242,
      "upstreamCategory": "a",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "note": "社区收录译句；保留上游文字，不标注未经证实的说话人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "h-c3e5fa24-1b33-4532-8ac0-2bcba75e2080",
      "text": "梦总是有会醒来的时候，不会醒的梦总有一天会变成悲伤。",
      "work": "AIR",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/hitokoto-osc/sentences-bundle/blob/8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad/sentences/a.json#L3532",
      "upstreamId": 260,
      "upstreamCategory": "a",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "note": "社区收录译句；保留上游文字，不标注未经证实的说话人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "h-73c4c400-243b-4369-9675-1bc93a1eb12c",
      "text": "能哭的地方只有厕所和爸爸的怀里。",
      "work": "CLANNAD",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/hitokoto-osc/sentences-bundle/blob/8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad/sentences/a.json#L3546",
      "upstreamId": 261,
      "upstreamCategory": "a",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "note": "社区收录译句；保留上游文字，不标注未经证实的说话人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "h-d408b05f-19e2-4278-a8a9-5750d8d2e989",
      "text": "真正重要的东西，永远都是非常简单的。",
      "work": "CLANNAD",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/hitokoto-osc/sentences-bundle/blob/8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad/sentences/a.json#L6318",
      "upstreamId": 867,
      "upstreamCategory": "a",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "note": "社区收录译句；保留上游文字，不标注未经证实的说话人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "h-31e561a2-b4f2-4c3b-82e0-d907d837d129",
      "text": "笑是对身边的事物感到一瞬间的幸福而表现出来的东西。",
      "work": "CLANNAD",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/hitokoto-osc/sentences-bundle/blob/8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad/sentences/a.json#L6472",
      "upstreamId": 888,
      "upstreamCategory": "a",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "note": "社区收录译句；保留上游文字，不标注未经证实的说话人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "h-60032758-690e-4bdf-8c99-2dc3bdf70b11",
      "text": "人没有回忆是无法活下去的哟",
      "work": "AIR",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/hitokoto-osc/sentences-bundle/blob/8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad/sentences/a.json#L9524",
      "upstreamId": 3670,
      "upstreamCategory": "a",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "note": "社区收录译句；保留上游文字，不标注未经证实的说话人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "h-866a47c8-4005-4508-b8d4-0371fc2e8483",
      "text": "美好的事情，现在才开始呐。",
      "work": "CLANNAD",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/hitokoto-osc/sentences-bundle/blob/8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad/sentences/a.json#L14816",
      "upstreamId": 6250,
      "upstreamCategory": "a",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "note": "社区收录译句；保留上游文字，不标注未经证实的说话人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "h-0d65aaed-fc56-47fc-a3dc-3044622efaa2",
      "text": "即便分开，羁绊仍然是存在的，这就是所谓的家人。",
      "work": "CLANNAD",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/hitokoto-osc/sentences-bundle/blob/8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad/sentences/a.json#L15488",
      "upstreamId": 6754,
      "upstreamCategory": "a",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "note": "社区收录译句；保留上游文字，不标注未经证实的说话人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "h-865ac7f8-deca-4178-8925-103bc029fc6a",
      "text": "世界上没有一成不变的事物，所以只要以其他方式找到自己的快乐就行了。",
      "work": "CLANNAD",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/hitokoto-osc/sentences-bundle/blob/8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad/sentences/a.json#L15502",
      "upstreamId": 6755,
      "upstreamCategory": "a",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "note": "社区收录译句；保留上游文字，不标注未经证实的说话人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "h-27bf09c9-a3be-48a6-901f-b41924d5ff2a",
      "text": "我也很没用，但是两个人一起的话，就会变得很坚强。",
      "work": "CLANNAD",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/hitokoto-osc/sentences-bundle/blob/8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad/sentences/a.json#L18232",
      "upstreamId": 8886,
      "upstreamCategory": "a",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "note": "社区收录译句；保留上游文字，不标注未经证实的说话人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "h-52753952-a6df-4384-8f6f-07e195c822df",
      "text": "如果在明天起床之后，发现我们变成了一对恋人，你会觉得很有意思吗？",
      "work": "CLANNAD",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/hitokoto-osc/sentences-bundle/blob/8b30ce7566877bf2a1c5e07ee5199afcedd5b3ad/sentences/a.json#L18274",
      "upstreamId": 8907,
      "upstreamCategory": "a",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "note": "社区收录译句；保留上游文字，不标注未经证实的说话人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "web-88b0b333c2b42a91",
      "text": "只要鸟儿和风，永远永远，都是那样的自由。",
      "work": "秋之回忆2",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://galgamewords.wordpress.com/2022/10/08/%E3%80%8A%E7%A7%8B%E4%B9%8B%E5%9B%9E%E5%BF%862%E3%80%8B/",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "原作权利人保留权利（短摘）",
      "note": "独立短句。"
    },
    {
      "id": "web-db296f2bf2c94520",
      "text": "这个世界，往前便是未来，往后便是回忆，取一角便是故事。",
      "work": "灰色的果实",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://galgamewords.wordpress.com/2022/10/02/%E3%80%8A%E7%81%B0%E8%89%B2%E7%9A%84%E6%9E%9C%E5%AE%9E%E3%80%8B/",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "原作权利人保留权利（短摘）",
      "note": "合并网页换行。"
    },
    {
      "id": "web-608b8721d53d316e",
      "text": "我们相遇在一眨眼的“瞬间”。",
      "work": "LUNARiA",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://galgamewords.wordpress.com/2022/09/26/%E3%80%8Alunaria%E3%80%8B/",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "原作权利人保留权利（短摘）",
      "note": "独立短句。"
    },
    {
      "id": "web-9c1723f6ba9950dc",
      "text": "没有名字的东西，就算能感知到，也仍是无法理解的。",
      "work": "青空下的加缪",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://galgamewords.wordpress.com/2022/09/23/%E3%80%8A%E9%9D%92%E7%A9%BA%E4%B8%8B%E7%9A%84%E5%8A%A0%E7%BC%AA%E3%80%8B/",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "原作权利人保留权利（短摘）",
      "note": "合并网页换行。"
    },
    {
      "id": "web-372b8dbd50c8c648",
      "text": "虽然绕了好大好远的弯子，但还是要……——再做一次尝试。",
      "work": "Re:Lief～献给亲爱的你～",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://galgamewords.wordpress.com/2022/09/21/%E3%80%8Arelief%E7%8C%AE%E7%BB%99%E4%BA%B2%E7%88%B1%E7%9A%84%E4%BD%A0%E3%80%8B/",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "原作权利人保留权利（短摘）",
      "note": "合并网页换行。"
    },
    {
      "id": "web-2539f79c830ad8b4",
      "text": "正因为能感到悲伤，我们才被允许拥有感情。",
      "work": "Harmonia",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://galgamewords.wordpress.com/2022/09/21/%E3%80%8Aharmonia%E3%80%8B/",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "原作权利人保留权利（短摘）",
      "note": "独立短摘。"
    },
    {
      "id": "web-abf90ffaef0819ad",
      "text": "我、我呀，想活着。想一直活下去。",
      "work": "加奈，欢迎回来！",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://galgamewords.wordpress.com/2022/09/21/%E3%80%8A%E5%8A%A0%E5%A5%88%EF%BC%8C%E6%AC%A2%E8%BF%8E%E5%9B%9E%E6%9D%A5%EF%BC%81%E3%80%8B/",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "原作权利人保留权利（短摘）",
      "note": "独立短句，去除外层引号。"
    },
    {
      "id": "web-6454db1b88eac137",
      "text": "哪里都可以去，也就是哪里都没有我的容身之处。",
      "work": "悠久之翼",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://galgamewords.wordpress.com/2022/09/19/%E3%80%8A%E6%82%A0%E4%B9%85%E4%B9%8B%E7%BF%BC%E3%80%8B/",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "原作权利人保留权利（短摘）",
      "note": "独立分句。"
    },
    {
      "id": "web-90a53dc2667149db",
      "text": "人最能感到幸福的，是将要跨越障碍的那个瞬间。",
      "work": "星恋＊Twinkle",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://galgamewords.wordpress.com/2022/09/20/%E3%80%8A%E6%98%9F%E6%81%8B%EF%BC%8Atwinkle%E3%80%8B/",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "原作权利人保留权利（短摘）",
      "note": "合并网页换行。"
    },
    {
      "id": "web-6f57ac2f248974df",
      "text": "人正因流泪才可以忍耐住每天发生的事。",
      "work": "不要践踏天使的羽毛",
      "speaker": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://galgamewords.wordpress.com/2022/09/20/%E3%80%8A%E4%B8%8D%E8%A6%81%E8%B7%B5%E8%B8%8F%E5%A4%A9%E4%BD%BF%E7%9A%84%E7%BE%BD%E6%AF%9B%E3%80%8B/",
      "preferred": false,
      "license": "原作权利人保留权利（短摘）",
      "note": "从已核对摘录中截取独立分句。"
    }
  ]
}
